# Title: Dism Remove Online Package
# ID: 43e32da2-fdd0-4156-90de-50dfd62636f9
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: frack113
# Date: 2022-01-16
# Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
# Description: Deployment Image Servicing and Management tool. DISM is used to enumerate, install, uninstall, configure, and update features and packages in Windows images
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((process_path="*\\Dism.exe" AND (process_exec="*/Online*" AND process_exec="*/Disable-Feature*")) OR (process_path="*\\DismHost.exe" AND (parent_process_exec="*/Online*" AND parent_process_exec="*/Disable-Feature*")))
